{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33699","headline":"翰林作 · 刘邺","name":"翰林作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾是江波垂钓人，自怜深厌九衢尘。\n浮生渐老年随水，往事曾闻泪满巾。\n已觉远天秋色动，不堪闲夜雨声频。\n多惭不是相如笔，虚直金銮接侍臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}